@startuml
title DSH：配置组装与实际执行是两条不同的检查线
skinparam defaultFontName PingFang SC
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #425466
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #F3F7FA
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #607D8B
rectangle "Profile 中的 Bundle 列表\n按声明顺序组合" as bundles
rectangle "Profile patch → Home patch\n→ 命令行 patch" as patches
rectangle "有效配置树\n--dump-config 可观察" as tree
rectangle "Cordis 加载插件\n依赖服务、注册与生命周期" as cordis
rectangle "当前 Agent 的能力\n上下文、工具、执行策略" as agent
rectangle "模型请求与工具执行\n结果进入会话记录" as execution
bundles --> patches
patches --> tree
tree --> cordis
cordis --> agent
agent --> execution
note right of tree
  出现在配置树中
  不等于加载成功
end note
note right of agent
  工具已注册
  不等于获准执行
end note
@enduml
